OL,3,CProgramme listings for FRI 29 MAY
OL,4,G2200FLate Junction
OL,5,     GVerity Sharp shares a remote
OL,6,     Gcollaboration session between
OL,7,     Gtrumpeter Laura Jurd and poet
OL,8,     GAnthony Joseph, celebrating the
OL,9,     Glegacy of jazz icon Miles Davis
OL,10,     Gon his centenary.
OL,11,G2330F'Round Midnight
OL,12,     GSoweto presents music from a
OL,13,     Gselection of previously
OL,14,     Gunreleased recordings of Miles
OL,15,     GDavis live in concert, ranging
OL,16,     Gfrom the 1960s to 1980s.
